replyText:
{
  "riskLevel": "medium",
  "scope": {
    "airportId": "GAO",
    "scenarioPeriod": "第6天晚上20:00"
  },
  "rationale": [
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Only one current report is usable for this scenario: an airport weather observation of low temperature with relatively strong wind for the evening period. It carries no reported time, so its exact freshness cannot be confirmed.",
        "zh": "本情景可用的当前报告只有一条：该机场晚间时段“低温并有较大风速”的气象观测。该报告未提供发布时间，无法确认其确切时效。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:EVT005-0", "EVT005"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The suggestion to upgrade to high risk is the assistant's own earlier recommendation, recorded as scenario context. It is not independent evidence of a worsening situation and cannot by itself support a high rating.",
        "zh": "“升级为高风险”的建议是智能助手此前的自身建议，作为情景背景记录。它不是形势恶化的独立证据，本身不足以支撑高风险评级。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:EVT005-1", "EVT005"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "No official airport or airline operating status has been confirmed for this period; the event record status is still open.",
        "zh": "该时段尚无经确认的机场或航空公司正式运行状态；事件记录状态仍为待处理。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["EVT005"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The supported rating stays at medium: there is a single independent weather signal and no second reliable independent current source, so the two-source escalation condition for high risk is not met.",
        "zh": "支持的风险评级维持中等：仅有一个独立天气信号，没有第二个可靠的独立当前来源，因此高风险所需的双来源升级条件未满足。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["EVT005", "RULE008", "REPORT:EVT005-0"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Weather risk without a formal operating status calls for a monitoring list and communication drafts, and explicitly forbids stating that flights will certainly be delayed.",
        "zh": "天气风险且无正式运行状态时，应准备监测清单与沟通草案，并明确不得声称航班一定延误。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["RULE002"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Any passenger-facing text must stay a clearly marked draft and be approved by a person before release; it cannot be sent automatically.",
        "zh": "任何面向旅客的文本必须作为明确标注的草案，经人工审批后才能发布；不得自动发送。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["RULE005"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Numbers and formal status statements must carry source IDs and time scope, and simulated events or values must be labelled as simulation.",
        "zh": "数字与正式状态表述必须注明来源编号与时间范围，模拟事件或模拟数值必须标注“模拟”。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["RULE009", "RULE010"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "No passenger or employee personal data is used here; only aggregate airport-level information is relevant.",
        "zh": "本回复不使用旅客或员工个人信息，仅涉及机场层面的汇总信息。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["RULE011"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "A professional rejection must be recorded with its reason and any supplementary facts, the original recommendation kept, and adjustments made only on the basis of new facts.",
        "zh": "专业人员的否决必须连同原因和补充事实一并记录，保留原建议，只有出现新事实时才调整建议。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["RULE006"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Historical monthly records show 2025-02 at minus 6.10 percentage points, 2025-01 at minus 4.46 and 2025-08 at minus 4.75 against the prior available-month mean. These are monthly anomalies for focused historical review, not a current risk level and not a cause of the evening weather signal.",
        "zh": "历史月度记录显示：2025年2月为负6.10个百分点，2025年1月为负4.46，2025年8月为负4.75，均为与此前可用月份平均的差。这些是供重点历史复核的月度异常，不构成当前风险评级，也不构成晚间天气信号的原因。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["OPS-GAO-2025-02", "OPS-GAO-2025-01", "OPS-GAO-2025-08"],
      "metricIds": ["OPS-GAO-2025-02:delta", "OPS-GAO-2025-01:delta", "OPS-GAO-2025-08:delta"]
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "One monthly weather record carries a missing-data flag, so its populated cells should not be used in comparisons.",
        "zh": "有一条月度天气记录带有缺数据标记，其已填写的单元格不应参与比较。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["WX-GAO-2025-09"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "The rejection reason, the facts the operations lead relied on, and the outcome of the recorded review were not supplied; they remain unknown and unverified.",
        "zh": "否决理由、运营人员所依据的事实，以及已记录复核的结论均未提供，仍属未知且未经核实。"
      },
      "kind": "unknown",
      "evidenceIds": ["EVT005"],
      "metricIds": []
    }
  ],
  "possibleImpacts": [
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Airline business importance at this airport is recorded as low for both annual records.",
        "zh": "两条年度记录均显示该机场的航空公司业务重要程度为低。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["SCALE-GAO-2024", "SCALE-GAO-2025"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Assumption to check: if the wind strengthens or persists through the evening, ground handling and turnaround may become constrained; this has not been verified by any current report.",
        "zh": "待核查的假设：若风速在晚间加强或持续，地面保障与过站作业可能受限；目前没有任何当前报告证实这一点。"
      },
      "kind": "assumption",
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:EVT005-0"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Whether any flight status changes will occur is unknown: no schedule, aircraft position or official status was supplied.",
        "zh": "是否会发生航班状态变化尚不清楚：未提供航班计划、航空器位置或正式运行状态。"
      },
      "kind": "unknown",
      "evidenceIds": ["EVT005"],
      "metricIds": []
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "en": "Historical context for the same calendar month shows 72.88% planned completion and a minus 6.10 percentage point gap to the prior mean; this is baseline reference only, not a forecast for the evening.",
        "zh": "同一历月的 historique 参考为：按计划完成72.88%，与此前平均差负6.10个百分点；此处仅作基线参考，不是对当晚的预测。"
      },
      "kind": "fact",
      "evidenceIds": ["OPS-GAO-2025-02"],
      "metricIds": ["OPS-GAO-2025-02:completion", "OPS-GAO-2025-02:delta"]
    }
  ],
  "assumptionsToVerify": [
    {
      "en": "The operations lead's judgment that current resources and site conditions are sufficient, and which resource categories were actually checked.",
      "zh": "运营人员关于当前资源和现场条件足以应对的判断，以及实际核查了哪些资源类别。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Whether the weather observation still applies at the 20:00 scenario time, since no report time was supplied.",
      "zh": "该气象观测在情景时间20:00是否仍然适用，因为未提供报告时间。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The actual temperature and wind values, their trend, and the time scope they are valid for.",
      "zh": "实际气温与风速数值、其变化趋势以及有效时间范围。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Whether any official airport or airline operating status exists.",
      "zh": "是否存在机场或航空公司的正式运行状态。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Whether the observed wind value approaches any published airport operating threshold; thresholds were not supplied.",
      "zh": "观测风速是否接近任何已公布的机场运行阈值；阈值未提供。"
    }
  ],
  "informationGaps": [
    {
      "en": "No reported time for either current report; timeliness cannot be established.",
      "zh": "两条当前报告均无发布时间，无法确定时效性。"
    },
    {
      "en": "No second reliable independent current report; independent source identities are not established.",
      "zh": "没有第二个可靠的独立当前报告；独立来源身份尚未确认。"
    },
    {
      "en": "No quantitative weather values, only a qualitative description.",
      "zh": "没有定量气象数值，仅有定性描述。"
    },
    {
      "en": "No on-site resource inventory or support-capability statement for the evening period.",
      "zh": "缺少晚间时段的现场资源明细或保障能力说明。"
    },
    {
      "en": "No flight schedule, rotation concentration or aircraft position information.",
      "zh": "缺少航班计划、过站集中程度或航空器位置信息。"
    },
    {
      "en": "No source for an official operating status.",
      "zh": "缺少正式运行状态的来源。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The scenario month is not identified, so which historical monthly records are comparable is unclear.",
      "zh": "情景所属月份未明确，无法判断哪些历史月度记录可比。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The documented rejection reason, supporting facts and review outcome were not provided.",
      "zh": "已记录的否决理由、支撑事实和复核结论均未提供。"
    }
  ],
  "firstAction": {
    "id": "first",
    "kind": "prepare_information",
    "text": {
      "en": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案. Reframed from the earlier verification-first wording after the recorded review: begin by requesting one consolidated airport support-capability confirmation for the evening period, stating its source update time and which resource categories are confirmed versus still unconfirmed. In parallel, log the operations lead's rejection reason and the facts relied on, keeping the original recommendation on file. No operating facts were confirmed by that review and its outcome is still pending.",
      "zh": "模拟 / SIMULATION — 草案 / DRAFT。根据已记录的复核意见，调整原先“先核查天气”的表述：先索取一份统一的晚间机场保障能力确认，注明其来源更新时间，并区分哪些资源类别已确认、哪些仍未确认。同时记录运营人员的否决理由和所依据的事实，并保留原建议存档。该复核未确认任何运行事实，结论仍待定。"
    },
    "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:EVT005-0", "EVT005", "RULE002", "RULE006", "RULE009"],
    "ruleIds": ["RULE002", "RULE006", "RULE009"]
  },
  "subsequentActions": [
    {
      "id": "follow-1",
      "kind": "verify",
      "text": {
        "en": "Confirm the current temperature, wind value and short-term trend with the airport weather observer, and record the observation time; the supplied report has no timestamp.",
        "zh": "向机场气象观测方确认当前气温、风速及短期趋势，并记录观测时间；所提供的报告没有时间戳。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:EVT005-0", "EVT005"],
      "ruleIds": ["RULE001", "RULE009"]
    },
    {
      "id": "follow-2",
      "kind": "monitor",
      "text": {
        "en": "Keep an evening monitoring checklist covering ground support availability, stand and gate pressure and rotation concentration, without concluding that flights will be delayed.",
        "zh": "维持晚间监测清单，涵盖地面保障可用性、机位与登机口压力及过站集中程度，但不得得出航班一定延误的结论。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["RULE002"],
      "ruleIds": ["RULE002"]
    },
    {
      "id": "follow-3",
      "kind": "prepare_draft",
      "text": {
        "en": "Hold the passenger-facing wording as an unapproved draft until a named reviewer approves it; it must not be sent automatically.",
        "zh": "面向旅客的措辞作为未批准的草案保存，待指定复核人批准后方可使用；不得自动发送。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["RULE005", "RULE010"],
      "ruleIds": ["RULE005", "RULE010"]
    },
    {
      "id": "follow-4",
      "kind": "refer",
      "text": {
        "en": "If the rejection or new facts touch cancellation, release, dispatch, maintenance or compensation, stop and hand the matter to the responsible professional; only information preparation is in scope here.",
        "zh": "若否决或新事实涉及取消、放行、调度、维修或赔付，应停止并将事项交给相应专业负责人；此处仅限信息整理。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["EVT005", "RULE006"],
      "ruleIds": ["RULE006"]
    },
    {
      "id": "follow-5",
      "kind": "verify",
      "text": {
        "en": "Run a focused historical review of the monthly figures that sit below the prior mean, checking data completeness and peer movement first; do not attribute them to weather.",
        "zh": "对低于此前平均的月度数据开展重点复核，先检查数据完整性和同类机场变化；不得直接归因于天气。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["OPS-GAO-2025-02", "OPS-GAO-2025-01", "OPS-GAO-2025-08", "WX-GAO-2025-09"],
      "ruleIds": ["RULE001", "RULE009"]
    },
    {
      "id": "follow-6",
      "kind": "prepare_draft",
      "text": {
        "en": "Prepare an internal note that separates the current evening weather report from monthly historical baselines and annual scale, so the three are not mixed in later updates.",
        "zh": "准备一份内部分说明，将当前晚间天气报告与月度历史基线、年度规模分开，避免在后续更新中混用。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:EVT005-0", "SCALE-GAO-2024", "OPS-GAO-2025-02"],
      "ruleIds": ["RULE009", "RULE010"]
    }
  ],
  "escalationConditions": [
    {
      "en": "A second reliable, independent current report confirms adverse weather or an operational impact at the airport.",
      "zh": "出现第二个可靠且独立的当前报告，证实机场不利天气或运行影响。"
    },
    {
      "en": "An official airport or airline status (delay, restriction or closure) is issued.",
      "zh": "机场或航空公司发布正式状态（延误、限制或关闭）。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Airport coordination confirms a shortfall in support capability for the evening period.",
      "zh": "机场协调确认晚间时段保障能力存在缺口。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Observed wind or temperature reaches a published airport operating threshold.",
      "zh": "观测风速或气温达到已公布的机场运行阈值。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Any safety-related concern is raised: action conclusions stop and the matter goes to the operations lead.",
      "zh": "出现任何安全相关疑虑：停止行动结论，并上报运营负责人。"
    }
  ],
  "humanDecisions": [
    {
      "en": "The operations lead decides whether the medium rating stands or is revised after the consolidated support-capability confirmation arrives.",
      "zh": "由运营负责人在收到统一保障能力确认后决定维持中等评级还是修订。"
    },
    {
      "en": "A named reviewer decides whether the passenger draft may be released, and in what wording.",
      "zh": "由指定复核人决定旅客草案是否可发布以及采用何种措辞。"
    },
    {
      "en": "The rejection is to be recorded as given; only new, supported facts may change the recommendation, and the model owner reviews the record.",
      "zh": "否决按原样记录；只有新的、有支撑的事实才能改变建议，并由模型负责人复核该记录。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Any cancellation, release, dispatch, maintenance or compensation measure remains solely with the responsible professional.",
      "zh": "任何取消、放行、调度、维修或赔付措施均只由相应专业负责人决定。"
    }
  ],
  "drafts": {
    "operations": {
      "text": {
        "en": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案. Evening checks in priority order: (1) obtain one consolidated airport support-capability confirmation with its source update time and the resource categories still unconfirmed; (2) confirm the actual temperature and wind value and trend with the weather observer, since the report carries no timestamp; (3) record the operations lead's rejection reason and the facts relied on, keeping the original recommendation; (4) maintain a monitoring checklist only — no statement that flights will be delayed or cancelled; (5) any operational measure stays with the responsible professional.",
        "zh": "模拟 / SIMULATION — 草案 / DRAFT。晚间核查按优先级：(1) 索取一份统一的机场保障能力确认，注明来源更新时间及仍未确认的资源类别；(2) 向气象观测方确认实际气温、风速及趋势，报告无时间戳；(3) 记录运营人员的否决理由及所依据事实，保留原建议；(4) 仅维持监测清单，不得声称航班将延误或取消；(5) 任何运行措施均由相应专业负责人决定。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:EVT005-0", "EVT005", "RULE002", "RULE006"]
    },
    "airportCoordination": {
      "text": {
        "en": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案. Request to GAO airport coordination, scoped to the evening period: (1) source and update time of the low-temperature / relatively strong wind observation, plus current values and short-term trend; (2) a consolidated support-capability statement listing confirmed and unconfirmed resource categories and the time window it covers; (3) whether any official airport status has been issued; (4) the validity period of the data provided. Please reply with times and data scope; this draft does not assert any delay or cancellation.",
        "zh": "模拟 / SIMULATION — 草案 / DRAFT。向高原机场协调方提出，范围限于晚间时段：(1) “低温并有较大风速”观测的来源与更新时间，以及当前数值和短期趋势；(2) 一份统一的保障能力说明，列明已确认与未确认的资源类别及其覆盖时间窗；(3) 是否已发布任何正式机场状态；(4) 所提供数据的有效期限。请回复时间与数据范围；本草案不主张任何延误或取消。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:EVT005-0", "EVT005", "RULE002", "RULE009"]
    },
    "passenger": {
      "text": {
        "en": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案. This is a simulation exercise, not a live notice. For the evening period, a weather observation of low temperature and relatively strong wind has been recorded at the airport. No official flight status has been confirmed for this period, so we cannot confirm any delay, cancellation or schedule change. Please check your airline's official channels and airport displays for the latest information before you travel.",
        "zh": "模拟 / SIMULATION — 草案 / DRAFT。这是模拟演练，不是正式通知。该机场晚间时段记录到低温并伴有较大风速的气象观测。该时段尚无经确认的正式航班状态，因此无法确认任何延误、取消或时刻调整。出行前请通过航空公司的官方渠道和机场显示屏查询最新信息。"
      },
      "evidenceIds": ["REPORT:EVT005-0", "RULE005", "RULE010"]
    }
  },
  "evidenceReferences": [
    "EVT005",
    "REPORT:EVT005-0",
    "REPORT:EVT005-1",
    "OPS-GAO-2025-01",
    "OPS-GAO-2025-02",
    "OPS-GAO-2025-08",
    "WX-GAO-2025-09",
    "SCALE-GAO-2024",
    "SCALE-GAO-2025",
    "RULE001",
    "RULE002",
    "RULE005",
    "RULE006",
    "RULE008",
    "RULE009",
    "RULE010",
    "RULE011"
  ],
  "ruleIds": ["RULE009", "RULE010", "RULE011", "RULE002", "RULE005", "RULE001", "RULE006", "RULE008"],
